@startuml hostelhub_sequence

actor Guest
participant "Frontend" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Email Service" as Email

Guest -> UI: Search Hostels
UI -> API: GET /listings?search=...
API -> DB: Query listings
DB --> API: Return listings
API --> UI: Display results

Guest -> UI: Click on Listing
UI -> API: GET /listings/{id}
API -> DB: Query listing details
DB --> API: Return details
API --> UI: Show listing

Guest -> UI: Submit Inquiry
UI -> API: POST /inquiry
API -> DB: Save inquiry
DB --> API: Inquiry saved
API -> Email: Send notification
Email --> API: Email sent
API --> UI: Inquiry submitted

Host -> UI: View Inquiry
UI -> API: GET /inquiries/{id}
API -> DB: Query inquiry
DB --> API: Return inquiry
API --> UI: Display inquiry

Host -> UI: Accept Inquiry
UI -> API: PUT /inquiry/{id}/accept
API -> DB: Update inquiry status
DB --> API: Status updated
API -> Email: Send confirmation
Email --> API: Email sent
API --> UI: Booking confirmed

Guest -> UI: View Bookings
UI -> API: GET /bookings
API -> DB: Query guest bookings
DB --> API: Return bookings
API --> UI: Display bookings

@enduml